        "result_postgres_type": "jsonb",
        "signature": "aap_workspace_v1.delete_project(uuid, uuid, uuid, jsonb)",
        "transaction_semantics": "The binding borrows the caller's already-active transaction. Credential admission and commit remain caller-owned; the Native coordinator rechecks current authority. A failed outer commit rolls back the project graph, audit row, and receipt."
